I hate you. I really hate you.

728
00:53:41.467 --> 00:53:42.991
Hey...

729
00:53:44.069 --> 00:53:47.470
...so the hospital...

730
00:53:47.873 --> 00:53:50.967
...it throws this dance for sick kids.

731
00:53:51.143 --> 00:53:55.011
It's really dorky.
It's done like a regular prom.

732
00:53:55.180 --> 00:53:59.207
With a band and tuxes
and punch spiked with platelets...

733
00:53:59.385 --> 00:54:05.221
...and last year I went stag
and it was really dumb.

734
00:54:06.625 --> 00:54:08.354
But I was thinking...

735
00:54:08.527 --> 00:54:13.089
