Did you see her looking at my scarf?

744
00:54:37.856 --> 00:54:39.585
-Maybe she liked the pattern.
-Really?

745
00:54:39.758 --> 00:54:41.783
-Yeah.
-That dress sucked anyway.

746
00:54:41.961 --> 00:54:43.519
