really good, for one night.

751
00:54:57.076 --> 00:54:58.373
What?

752
00:55:29.508 --> 00:55:30.941
SARA: Are you ready?
ANNA: Okay, ready!

753
00:55:31.110 --> 00:55:32.236
Come here. Hurry, quick.

754
00:55:33.879 --> 00:55:35.176
She's coming down.

755
00:55:35.714 --> 00:55:37.739
Oh, my God.

756
00:55:37.916 --> 00:55:39.110
KELLY: There she is!
SARA: Oh, my God.

757
00:55:39.284 --> 00:55:43.311
That is just so beautiful. Look how
beautiful. Doesn't she look beautiful?

758
00:55:43.489 --> 00:55:45.320
Wait, stay right there.
Don't come down.

759
00:55:45.491 --> 00:55:48.085
-Honey, you look so beautiful.
ANNA: No, she looks pretty.

760
00:55:48.260 --> 00:55:50.922
Okay, wait, wait, wait, stop.
Can you just come down?

761
00:55:51.096 --> 00:55:54.429
I wanna see your guys'-- Wait.
Kate, go back up the stairs for a second.

762
00:55:54.600 --> 00:55:56.591
I wanna see you coming down
with your hands.

763
00:55:56.769 --> 00:55:58.168
Can you look this way, Taylor?

764
00:55:58.337 --> 00:56:00.430
Excellent.
Wait, hold on, hold on, here we go.

765
00:56:00.606 --> 00:56:04.007
Wait, I wanna get a Polaroid too. Hold on.
Kate? Can I see your face?

766
00:56:04.443 --> 00:56:05.535
Oh, excellent.

767
00:56:05.711 --> 00:56:07.201
Okay, right there.

768
00:56:07.379 --> 00:56:10.371
If you guys wanna stand right there.
There we go.

769
00:56:10.549 --> 00:56:13.882
-Ready? Okay, yes, stand right there.
ANNA: I didn't get enough pictures.

770
00:56:14.053 --> 00:56:16.715
KELLY: One more, okay?
SARA: You're kind of blocking it, sweetheart.

771
00:56:16.889 --> 00:56:18.322
-Can you just step--?
ANNA: I got it.

772
00:56:18.490 --> 00:56:20.117
-Kelly, you're in the picture.
KATE: Mom.

773
00:56:20.292 --> 00:56:21.691
