-Yeah, let me see that corsage.

776
00:56:25.664 --> 00:56:27.723
-Sweetie, but can I just see--?
KELLY: Say cheese!

777
00:56:27.900 --> 00:56:30.334
SARA: There we go. Excellent.
KELLY: Hi. Hi.

778
00:56:30.502 --> 00:56:32.129
Hi. Oh, sweet!

779
00:56:32.304 --> 00:56:34.465
