-Stop.

780
00:56:34.640 --> 00:56:36.665
ANNA:
Yeah, looks good. I like it.

781
00:56:36.842 --> 00:56:39.310
Mom. Mom, please. It's enough, okay?

782
00:56:39.478 --> 00:56:41.810
-I need to document this moment, okay?
ANNA: No, wait.

783
00:56:41.980 --> 00:56:43.311
SARA:
Just in front. There you--

784
00:56:43.482 --> 00:56:46.940
Oh, my God, that's so cute. All right.

785
00:56:47.119 --> 00:56:48.450
ANNA: Kate, Kate.
SARA: Oh, my God.

786
00:56:48.620 --> 00:56:52.021
Okay, let me just get a Polaroid of it too.
Wait, you got some. Sweetheart.

787
00:56:52.191 --> 00:56:54.989
ANNA: Hey, hold on.
SARA: Oh, honey.

788
00:56:59.231 --> 00:57:00.721
