Maybe it has nothing to do with you.

815
01:00:41.019 --> 01:00:42.247
We did it, okay?

816
01:00:42.421 --> 01:00:44.912
We did it
and now he won't call me back.

817
01:00:45.090 --> 01:00:47.285
-You did it?
-That's right.

818
01:00:47.459 --> 01:00:51.486
-What do you mean, "did it"? You did "it" it?
-No, but we did some stuff, okay?

819
01:00:51.663 --> 01:00:55.030
-"Stuff"? What kind of stuff?
-Mom, I don't wanna talk about it with you.

820
01:00:55.200 --> 01:00:57.862
I just told you because I'm mad.

821
01:01:01.873 --> 01:01:02.965
-Alice.
-Yeah, Sara?

822
01:01:03.141 --> 01:01:04.836
Taylor, have you seen him?

823
01:01:06.745 --> 01:01:08.235
What?

824
01:01:08.513 --> 01:01:10.743
I was sure somebody had told you.

825
01:01:10.916 --> 01:01:13.441
[lNAUDlBLE DlALOGUE]

826
01:01:41.146 --> 01:01:43.979
[lNAUDlBLE DlALOGUE]

827
01:02:29.094 --> 01:02:30.652
JESSE:
Stop the bus!

828
01:02:30.829 --> 01:02:33.855
Stop the bus! Stop!

829
01:02:34.032 --> 01:02:37.832
Tell him to stop that bus!
Hey, stop the bus, dude!

830
01:02:38.003 --> 01:02:39.868
Come on!

831
01:02:40.472 --> 01:02:42.337
Goddamn it!

832
01:03:33.425 --> 01:03:35.188
JESSE:
When I got home...

833
01:03:35.360 --> 01:03:37.988
...I wondered how much trouble I'd be in.

834
01:03:45.904 --> 01:03:48.168
Buddy? What are you doing up?

835
01:03:48.340 --> 01:03:50.399
-Can't sleep?
-I just-- I can't sleep.

836
01:03:50.575 --> 01:03:54.511
Look, I'm gonna go to the hospital, spend
the night with your sister. You wanna come?

837
01:03:54.946 --> 01:03:56.174
All right.

838
01:03:56.348 --> 01:03:57.815
-Yeah?
-Yeah. Sure, let me just--

839
