I'm gonna get a coffee,
get yourself ready.

840
01:04:01.052 --> 01:04:02.542
Hey, bud.

841
01:04:03.288 --> 01:04:04.949
Everything okay?

842
01:04:05.123 --> 01:04:06.147
Yeah.

843
01:04:20.705 --> 01:04:22.172
What?

844
01:04:23.041 --> 01:04:25.032
