845
01:04:25.210 --> 01:04:26.837
Sure.

846
01:04:27.512 --> 01:04:29.878
You really think you're gonna win?

847
01:04:30.715 --> 01:04:34.583
You really expect the judge
to take Anna's kidney against her will?

848
01:04:34.753 --> 01:04:36.482
Well, there's precedent.

849
01:04:36.655 --> 01:04:38.782
There's Hart v. Brown,
Masden v. Harrison...

850
01:04:38.957 --> 01:04:40.288
-...Strunk v. Strunk.
-I know.

851
01:04:40.458 --> 01:04:43.518
Besides, the court should just
mind their own business.

852
01:04:43.695 --> 01:04:45.663
Why? What's your point?

853
01:04:45.830 --> 01:04:47.422
-Don't start that shit.
-What?

854
01:04:47.599 --> 01:04:48.896
-I'm your sister.
-What shit?

855
01:04:49.067 --> 01:04:54.334
I'm behind you, no matter what.
I'll do whatever, and I do.

856
01:04:55.840 --> 01:04:58.035
I'm just not sure
you're seeing the big picture.

857
01:04:58.209 --> 01:05:00.973
What big picture, Kel? Spit it out.

858
01:05:02.581 --> 01:05:05.573
I know it's important for you
to feel like you never gave up.

859
01:05:05.750 --> 01:05:10.187
I mean, who are you if you're not this crazy
bitch mother fighting for her kid's life, right?

860
01:05:10.622 --> 01:05:15.025
But there's, like, a whole world out there.
You don't see any of it, nothing.

861
01:05:17.228 --> 01:05:19.458
Sooner or later, you--

862
01:05:20.699 --> 01:05:23.065
You gotta stop.

863
01:05:25.704 --> 01:05:28.172
You gotta let go.

864
01:05:34.312 --> 01:05:36.143
I can't.

865
01:05:37.649 --> 01:05:38.741
BRlAN:
How's she doing?

866
01:05:38.917 --> 01:05:42.819
She's exhausted.
Dialysis really wiped her out.

867
01:05:42.988 --> 01:05:45.286
KATE [FAlNTLY] :
I wanna go to the beach.

868
01:05:45.457 --> 01:05:47.982
-What did you say, baby?
