869
01:05:48.159 --> 01:05:52.027
It's the damnedest thing.
She's been talking about it all day.

870
01:05:59.804 --> 01:06:02.773
[WHlSPERS]
Dad, he's here.

871
01:06:02.941 --> 01:06:04.909
CHANCE:
You have to count to what, five?

872
01:06:05.076 --> 01:06:06.873
Well, you're not counting.

873
01:06:07.045 --> 01:06:09.741
-You gotta count.
-One, two, three, four, five.

874
01:06:09.914 --> 01:06:11.245
Okay. All right, sweetheart.

875
01:06:11.416 --> 01:06:13.008
[GROANS]

876
01:06:13.752 --> 01:06:16.778
All right, you beat me.

877
01:06:17.989 --> 01:06:19.684
How's our girl?

878
01:06:19.858 --> 01:06:22.486
Well, she wants to go to the beach.

879
01:06:24.696 --> 01:06:26.596
The beach, huh?

880
01:06:27.098 --> 01:06:29.532
I'm not sure that's a bad idea.

881
01:06:29.701 --> 01:06:32.499
She is not gonna be any sicker
at the beach than she is here.

882
01:06:32.671 --> 01:06:34.605
It might even be good for her.

883
01:06:35.807 --> 01:06:38.503
-Not too dangerous then, huh?
-I don't think so.

884
01:06:38.677 --> 01:06:42.238
She was dialyzed yesterday and she has
no scheduled treatments until Friday.

885
01:06:42.414 --> 01:06:46.578
Um, how do I do this? I mean, just get
her up and walk her out of here, or...?

886
01:06:46.751 --> 01:06:48.184
Discharge her for the day.

887
01:06:48.353 --> 01:06:50.981
The insurance company
will definitely not approve this...

888
01:06:51.156 --> 01:06:53.283
...so we'll have to re-admit
through emergency.

889
01:06:53.458 --> 01:06:58.623
But if she happened to be there at,
let's say, 7:00...

890
01:06:58.797 --> 01:07:01.527
...I just might be there to meet her.

891
01:07:02.967 --> 01:07:04.457
Okay.

892
01:07:04.936 --> 01:07:06.836
It's one day.

893
01:07:07.439 --> 01:07:11.535
Kate's been through the wringer,
so if it's not gonna make her any worse...

894
01:07:12.711 --> 01:07:16.807
...I say take the kid to the beach.

895
01:07:28.760 --> 01:07:30.990
ANNA: Hey, Dad, what's going on?
BRlAN: Hey.

896
01:07:31.162 --> 01:07:33.357
[lNAUDlBLE DlALOGUE]

897
01:07:34.065 --> 01:07:35.498
What?

898
01:07:38.670 --> 01:07:40.797
ANNA:
Oh, my God!

899
01:08:04.062 --> 01:08:07.190
Get your stuff.
March in, march out. One minute.

900
01:08:07.732 --> 01:08:10.462
SARA: Hey. What's going on?
BRlAN: We're going to the beach.

901
01:08:10.635 --> 01:08:12.728
-You're going to the beach?
-Get your bikini.

902
01:08:12.904 --> 01:08:15.896
-Kate? Kate, what are you doing--?
KATE: Mama, please. Don't--

903
01:08:16.074 --> 01:08:18.508
Wait a second,
what is she doing out of the hospital?

904
01:08:18.676 --> 01:08:23.306
Brian! Brian! It'll kill her! Give me the keys,
I'm taking her back to the hospital.

905
01:08:23.481 --> 01:08:27.076
Give me the keys, Brian! Let-- Give me!

906
01:08:28.520 --> 01:08:31.387
SARA: Are you insane? You trying to kill her?
BRlAN: I talked to Chance.

907
01:08:31.556 --> 01:08:35.014
SARA: I don't give a shit who you talked to!
You are killing her! You understand?

908
01:08:35.193 --> 01:08:36.922
Take her to the beach, you kill her!

909
01:08:37.095 --> 01:08:38.119
-Come on.
-No, please.

910
01:08:38.296 --> 01:08:40.730
SARA: Come on, sweetie. It's okay.
KATE: No, please, please!

911
01:08:40.899 --> 01:08:42.628
BRlAN: Don't do this.
-See how upset she is?

912
01:08:42.801 --> 01:08:43.893
See what you're doing?

913
01:08:44.068 --> 01:08:45.865
-I'll call cops.
-Do what you gotta do.

914
01:08:46.037 --> 01:08:49.768
-Last 14 years I've let you have it your way.
-Last 14 years have been about saving her!

915
01:08:49.941 --> 01:08:52.205
-Today is not about you.
SARA: You want to undermine that?

916
01:08:52.377 --> 01:08:53.605
BRlAN: It's about Kate.
SARA: It is.

917
01:08:53.778 --> 01:08:54.904
She wants to go to the beach.

918
01:08:55.079 --> 01:08:56.444
-lf you'd like--
-She's gonna die!

919
01:08:56.614 --> 01:08:59.742
-Better come, if you don't, I want a divorce.
-A divorce? Great!

920
01:08:59.918 --> 01:09:01.442
-Good.
-You got a fucking divorce!

921
01:09:01.619 --> 01:09:04.850
We're divorced, Mommy and me
are divorced. Sit in the car. In the car.

922
01:09:05.023 --> 01:09:06.490
SARA: No. Anna!
BRlAN: In the car!

923
01:09:07.058 --> 01:09:08.491
SARA:
Brian.

924
01:09:09.894 --> 01:09:12.294
-Give me the keys! This is ridiculous!
BRlAN: Stop.

925
01:09:12.463 --> 01:09:16.490
You're gonna regret this, Brian.
You understand? You're gonna regret this!

926
01:09:19.170 --> 01:09:20.262
Brian!

927
01:09:20.438 --> 01:09:23.965
Katie, sweetie,
you gotta go back to the hospital!

928
01:09:36.054 --> 01:09:38.716
[MUTED DlALOGUE]

929
01:13:39.363 --> 01:13:42.230
I don't suppose there's any way
